he opaque responses when requests exceeds timeout threshold ([#30977](https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/30977)) ([a9038ef](https://github.com/angular/angular/commit/a9038ef))\r\n> \r\n\r\nReading the other releases, there was many, many other changes on this release that are not on changelog of the version itself, but on `.rc*`, `.next-*`...\r\n\r\nShouldn't the changelog be a merge of all pre-release versions?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/31491/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/31491/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/516754068","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/30340#issuecomment-516754068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/30340","id":516754068,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUxNjc1NDA2OA==","user":{"login":"broweratcognitecdotcom","id":22955816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTU1ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22955816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/broweratcognitecdotcom","html_url":"https://github.com/broweratcognitecdotcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/broweratcognitecdotcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/broweratcognitecdotcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/broweratcognitecdotcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/broweratcognitecdotcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/broweratcognitecdotcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/broweratcognitecdotcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/broweratcognitecdotcom/repos","events_url":"https://ap